cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this framework, please cite it.
title: "discovery-loop: an auditable, self-correcting protocol for automated research on HPC"
abstract: >-
  A domain-agnostic framework for running automated research as an append-only
  loop across multiple agent harnesses. It enforces atomic iteration claiming,
  hash-frozen pre-declaration, append-only correction, and cross-checking by a
  harness from a different model family, on the grounds that a model reviewing
  its own output verifies that the work looks correctly generated rather than
  that it is correct.
type: software
license: MIT
